### `ui/src/dashboard/` - vendored from shadcndashboard

shadcndashboard (MIT) - https://github.com/shadcndashboard/shadcndashboard,
commit `6f99c0b04b7169f9ef12dc99946bc4faaeb40b9b` - see
`ui/docs/dashboard-upstream.md` for what was vendored and stripped. Its
own dependencies added here:

Local patch log for `ui-v0.5.86` (SHELL-FOLD-01, Home):
- `ui/src/dashboard/layouts/full/FullLayout.tsx`: additive optional
  `defaultSidebarOpen` (default remains `true`),
  `showSidebarTriggerInMenu`, `showHeaderSidebarTrigger` and
  `sidebarItemStatus` props. `resolveInitialSidebarOpen` reads the
  existing `sidebar_state=true|false` cookie before the caller default.
- `ui/src/dashboard/layouts/full/vertical/header/Header.tsx`: additive
  `showSidebarTrigger` (default `true`); uses the shipped
  `SidebarTrigger`, preserving header behavior for existing consumers.
- `ui/src/dashboard/layouts/full/vertical/sidebar/Sidebar.tsx`: optional
  shipped `SidebarTrigger` in the menu column and optional status prop.
- `ui/src/dashboard/layouts/full/vertical/sidebar/nav-collapse/index.tsx`
  and `nav-items/index.tsx`: thread optional status through and render
  the existing link through the shipped `SidebarMenuButton` tooltip prop
  with its item name as accessible name.
- Home `frontend/src/next/NextRoutes.tsx` passes the folded default and
  trigger relocation props; `frontend/src/next/pages/NextChatPage.tsx`
  and `frontend/src/apps/chat/chatHeaderBar.tsx` place history beside
  the chat title in the phone top row.

